    KNOWSUP --> KNOWLEDGE
    KNOWPRICE --> KNOWLEDGE
    KNOWDELIVERY --> KNOWLEDGE
    KNOWPROBLEM --> KNOWLEDGE
    KNOWANALOG --> KNOWLEDGE
